discussion. A remaining problem of previous and the present study is that it is hardly possible to causally attribute effects (or no effects) to the display type itself. Display hardware always differs in several aspects (e.g., resolution, image contrast, ...), some of which could have unknown, possibly interacting and counteracting effects. Although the causal interpretation should therefore be treated with caution, we conclude that the present study does not provide any evidence of negative implications of using HMDs in driving simulation.

